# Web app (copy to apps/web/.env.local). Leave VITE_API_URL unset to use same-origin /api:
# Vite proxies /api to the local worker in dev, and a Worker route serves it in production.
# Set it only when the API lives on another origin, e.g. https://anonletter-worker.<you>.workers.dev/api
# VITE_API_URL=

# Worker settings live in apps/worker/.dev.vars (local) and wrangler.toml / wrangler secrets
# (production). See apps/worker/.dev.vars.example and BACKEND_SETUP.md.
